      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone,</p>\n<p>I noticed something different about how “Global Search” works in v16</p>\n<p>Under v15 when you enter a partial customer name it would find the customer record in the search because customer name is marked to be included in Global Search.</p>\n<p>This is not working in v16.</p>\n<p>I made sure that Customer Name is marked to be included in Global Search and I rebuilt the search index</p>\n<p>Is this a BUG or am I missing something that needs to be set in v16</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>",
